;; What the system shrinks itself by (docs/health.md#a-form-too-long).
{
 ;; Unit: words of a Seon var's docstring. A longer one, or one holding a measurement, a date or a wiki page cited
 ;; twice, is an open :unfocused-docstring row (seon.problems/unfocused-docstrings), shown to a branch that changes the var
 ;; (attention, never refused) and closed by focusing it; docs/health.md#an-unfocused-docstring. Provenance: Clojure core's
 ;; p90 is 49 words; this program's 3,287 docstrings had median 38, p90 102 (2026-11-13; the owner set 50).
 :seon.config.shrink/docstring-words [:int {:default 50 :min 1 :seon.config/unit "words" :description "The most words a Seon var's docstring may hold; a longer one is an open :unfocused-docstring problem."}]
 ;; Unit: tokens of a form's :form/src as the model reads it (seon.print.emit/chars-tokens, the printer's
 ;; one estimate), src and test alike: about a printed page. A live form longer than this is an open
 ;; :long-form problem row (seon.problems/long-forms), shown to a branch that adds one (attention, never
 ;; refused) and closed by splitting it; docs/health.md#a-form-too-long. Provenance:
 ;; measured over this program (commit 3fac2a4f04): 2,082 src forms, 83 over 1,000 tokens and 20 over
 ;; 2,000 (seon.ref/scan 6,005); 2,052 test forms, 76 over 1,000.
 :seon.config.shrink/form-tokens [:int {:default 1000 :min 1 :seon.config/unit "tokens" :description "The most tokens (seon.print.emit/chars-tokens) a live form's source text (:form/src) may hold, in src or in a test; a longer one is an open :long-form problem."}]}
